<title>USA: Sled Dogs Co Q4 March 31 loss.</title>
<headline>Sled Dogs Co Q4 March 31 loss.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months ended March 31,</p>
<p>						  1997		  1996</p>
<p> Net sales			  $     49,039	  $   109,138</p>
<p> Net loss			    (2,069,386)	    (898,431)</p>
<p> Net loss per common share	    (0.15)		 (0.08)</p>
