<p>Weighted average number</p>
<p> of shares outstanding (1)(2)   13,265,220	    9,061,474 (1)</p>
<p>Actual shares of common stock issued and outstanding at March 31, 1997 were 13,513,193.  The weighted average number of shares outstanding reflect the exercise of 1,763,194 common stock warrants during the period July 15, 1996 to August 30, 1996. (2) Actual shares of common stock issued and outstanding March 31, 1996 and June 30, 1996 were 11,749,999.  The weighted average number of shares outstanding reflect the issuance of 8,000,000 shares on November 1, 1995 in a private placement of equity.</p>
<p>NOTE: March 31, 1997 is the company's new fiscal year end.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
